  "scope_notes": [
    "Pillow high-level SBOM lists optional features and does not prove they are compiled; actual native files, strings, Mac runtime feature versions and original producer flags were cross-checked.",
    "LittleCMS reports only 2.19 through its public runtime version API; the exact producer dependency manifest and wheel SBOM pin patch release 2.19.1.",
    "Mac raqm/FriBiDi features are disabled at runtime, but HarfBuzz 14.5.0 is still shipped and linked by FreeType; its exact source is therefore included in access records.",
    "Pillow libavif statically contains AOM 3.14.1 encoder, dav1d 1.5.3 decoder and pinned libyuv; libsharpyuv is supplied by the listed WebP 1.6.0 source.",
    "FriBiDi implementation and libimagequant are not bundled in these wheels; Pillow-authored fribidi-shim and raqm0.11.0 source/patches are included in the full Pillow source.",
    "Mac /usr/lib/libbz2 and Apple framework/system libraries are supplied by the OS and are not redistributed as Pillow private native libraries.",
    "Access-only source records identify exact original third-party releases/commits and recipes; they are not falsely marked as downloaded archives."
  ],
